1
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:13,880
Xiaoyu,

2
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:17,600
it's been hard for you

3
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:18,960
all these years.

4
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,520
Honestly,

5
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:23,280
sometimes

6
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,280
I don't even know how I got through it.

7
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:28,800
I understand.

8
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:30,120
Come on,

9
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,280
cheers to victory.

10
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:38,200
Xiaoyu,

11
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,640
you can't keep living in hatred.

12
00:00:41,080 --> 00:00:42,680
After all, life goes on.

13
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:44,800
You are still young.

14
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,120
But

15
00:00:46,680 --> 00:00:49,800
I feel like everything has suddenly lost direction.

16
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,880
How are you

17
00:00:59,960 --> 00:01:00,720
with Lin Jiming?

18
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,800
What do you mean?

19
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,440
I'm a woman,

20
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:10,840
and your best friend.

21
00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:12,560
I can feel

22
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,920
he has a place in your heart.

23
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,360
There's no chance

24
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:19,400
between him and me.

25
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:22,880
He's innocent.

26
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:25,080
No single snowflake is innocent

27
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:28,000
when an avalanche occurs.

28
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:41,880
Lin Jiming,

29
00:01:42,160 --> 00:01:42,920
open the door!

30
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,200
I know you're home.

31
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:45,680
Lin Jiming,

32
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:46,840
open the door!

33
00:01:48,080 --> 00:01:49,040
Lin Jiming,

34
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:50,120
open the door!

35
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,120
You coward!

36
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,640
Do you know what has happened to the Lin Group?

37
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:56,600
Are you just hiding at home?

38
00:01:57,600 --> 00:01:59,360
I used to like you.

39
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:00,960
You jerk!

40
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,160
What do you want from me?

41
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:16,400
Did my brother

42
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,880
tell you about Wen Yishi?

43
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:18,440
Oh.

44
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:19,200
No.

45
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,920
My brother

46
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:22,360
is still hesitant.

47
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,120
It's normal to be hesitant.

48
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,160
I'm here today

49
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,360
to talk about Lin Jiming.

50
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,160
He

51
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,960
is actually quite pitiful.

52
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:46,920
What do you want to say?

53
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,320
I went to see him last night,

54
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:49,880
but he didn't see me.

55
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:51,080
He didn't even open the door.

56
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,160
Chen Fang said

57
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:54,200
he hadn't been out for many days.

58
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,720
He didn't answer any calls.

59
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:57,080
What does that have to do with me?

60
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,920
Aren't you his girlfriend?

61
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,120
And

62
00:03:00,600 --> 00:03:01,760
he likes you very much.

63
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:02,880
He treats you well.

64
00:03:03,480 --> 00:03:05,200
I think you should talk to him.

65
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:05,920
No one wants to

66
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,600
see him in this situation.

67
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,520
But some things

68
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,120
can only be overcome by oneself.

69
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:13,280
Don't you think?

70
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:15,000
So you dare to say

71
00:03:15,280 --> 00:03:17,400
that you have no responsibility

72
00:03:17,480 --> 00:03:18,800
for his current situation?

73
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,480
Actually, life is like snooker.

74
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:34,800
Sometimes,

75
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:35,960
mistakes

76
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:37,800
are the best offense.

77
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:39,760
Tiantian,

78
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,200
if you dare to mess with the Liu family,

79
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,480
you'll be fired

80
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:50,120
as our legal counsel today.

81
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,960
As long as I'm the CEO of Lin Group,

82
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,440
she won't

83
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,400
leave.

84
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,760
Then do you dare to say

85
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:03,040
that you have no responsibility

86
00:04:03,160 --> 00:04:04,600
for his current situation?

87
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,040
I got this

88
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,120
from Chen Fang.

89
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:34,600
He said

90
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:36,040
Lin Jiming kept this card

91
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:38,400
for you as a backup.

92
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:39,880
Whether to go or not,

93
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:40,840
whether to persuade or not,

94
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,080
the choice is yours.

95
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,800
I hope I'm not wrong about you.

96
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,040
Tiantian.

97
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,120
Why are you here?

98
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,400
I came to see if you're dead.

99
00:05:30,840 --> 00:05:32,160
If you're not,

100
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:36,000
look at this.

101
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,880
Everything is here.

102
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:42,640
Does it still matter?

103
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,680
What do you mean by that?

104
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:50,760
Look at yourself now.

105
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,360
You look like the garbage

106
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,000
Wen Shiyi used and threw away.

107
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:56,160
Are you willing to rot here?

108
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,040
Answer me, Lin Jiming.

109
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:01,000
Or should I call you

110
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:02,400
Wu Jiming?

111
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:10,840
What about you?

112
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,040
Are you

113
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,000
Guan Tiantian

114
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:20,640
or Gu Qingyu?

115
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,360
Have you ever,

116
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:24,200
even just for a moment,

117
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:26,280
been genuinely sincere with me?

118
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:27,840
Or

119
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:31,000
from the first time we met,

120
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:33,080
every time you got close,

121
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:34,520
every glance,

122
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:35,680
every smile,

123
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,360
was just part of your revenge plan?

124
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:41,960
What am I, just a pawn in your game?

125
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:43,640
Ah!

126
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:06,080
The sun was shining that day,

127
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,560
just like today.

128
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,880
What do you think

129
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:13,680
we should name our baby?

130
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:14,560
Wang Yile.

131
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:15,360
How does that sound?

132
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:16,400
Hmm.

133
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,720
[That was the last time I felt]

134
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,560
[my future was bright.]

135
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:30,720
That day, Jiming was cutting vegetables in the kitchen,

136
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:32,680
humming a song.

137
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,840
He came up with so many names

138
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,840
for our future child.

139
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,560
Names for a boy,

140
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,080
names for a girl.

141
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,880
Finally, he said the name Yueyue.

142
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,000
Yueyue is the best.

143
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:52,200
As long as we're happy.

144
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,520
Then there was a loud bang.

145
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,200
Ji Ming's scream.

146
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:57,720
Xiaoyu.

147
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:58,600
It stopped abruptly.

148
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,280
Heat wave.

149
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,280
After the glass shattered,

150
00:08:03,320 --> 00:08:04,520
I was flipped over onto the ground.

151
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,720
My stomach hurts so much.

152
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,920
When I woke up again, I was in the hospital.

153
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:16,600
My whole body hurts.

154
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,480
My face was wrapped up.

155
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,920
I instinctively touched my belly.

156
00:08:25,400 --> 00:08:26,280
It was flat.

157
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:29,400
The doctor said the baby was gone.

158
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:31,720
Ji Ming just...

159
00:08:33,160 --> 00:08:34,920
They said it was a gas leak.

160
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,560
Accident.

161
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:41,640
Accident.

162
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:44,960
This was not an accident at all.

163
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,120
It was murder.

164
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:49,680
Wen Shiyi was afraid that Jìmíng would come back

165
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,560
and fight for the property with her own son.

166
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,280
So she wanted us to die.

167
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,920
She ruined everything of mine.

168
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:55,840
My home.

169
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,520
My child.

170
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,520
My life.

171
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,520
I crawled back from hell alive.

172
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:01,440
I endured the pain of surgery time and time again.

173
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,760
I became a different person.

174
00:09:02,760 --> 00:09:04,200
not to hear you ask here

175
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,560
if I ever loved.

176
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,960
I did it to make her pay with her life.

177
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:09,320
Do you understand?

178
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:14,440
I thought you were my enemy.

179
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:17,560
I schemed to get close to you,

180
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,280
gain your trust,

181
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:20,440
even your love.

182
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,720
But then I realized

183
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:25,080
you weren't my enemy.

184
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:28,000
In a sense,

185
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,680
we are both victims.

186
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,880
The reason why I'm here today

187
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,240
is that I don't want to see

188
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,280
Lin Jiming I know

189
00:09:36,280 --> 00:09:37,920
become like this.

190
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,480
The evidence is all here.

191
00:09:47,400 --> 00:09:49,760
You can continue to be the trash of Wen Shiyi,

192
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:52,480
or get up and end all this.

193
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,120
It's up to you.

194
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,080
But I

195
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,960
will continue to fight.

196
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,480
I want to see Su Wei.

197
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,160
She is under criminal detention now.

198
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,760
The case is still in the investigation stage.

199
00:10:51,240 --> 00:10:52,520
You can't see her as you wish.

200
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,040
You should know the rules.

201
00:10:54,200 --> 00:10:56,160
I have accepted Su Wei's defense commission.

202
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,800
I just want to show her a clear path,

203
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,000
an opportunity to reduce her guilt.

204
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:04,600
If Su Wei is willing to turn into a state witness,

205
00:11:05,520 --> 00:11:06,960
Wen Shiyi can't hide anymore.

206
00:11:45,560 --> 00:11:46,840
Su Wei is a smart girl.

207
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,760
She should leave herself a way out.

208
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:51,240
Wen Shiyi's ship is about to sink.

209
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:54,200
She doesn't have to die with her.

210
00:11:54,800 --> 00:11:56,040
Do you think she will speak up?

211
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,400
She will figure it out.

212
00:11:58,040 --> 00:11:59,360
It just takes some time.

213
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:04,520
Okay.

214
00:12:04,680 --> 00:12:05,240
I see.

215
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:06,560
Handle it quickly.

216
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:07,440
Be clean.

217
00:12:07,880 --> 00:12:08,960
Don't make any mistakes.
